                <mxCell id="3095" value="&lt;b&gt;Key Bit-Width Formulas:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;wA = 1+eA+mA (FP) or 2+mA (INT)&lt;br/&gt;expW = max(eA,eB)+2&lt;br/&gt;mantW = (mA+1)+(mB+1)&lt;br/&gt;accW = 1+8+accMantBits&lt;br/&gt;accMantBits = auto(scfg, K)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Architecture Optimization:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;UE8M0 → no multiplier, no LZC&lt;br/&gt;in ScaleAdd stage&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;INT8×INT8 → productExpRange=0&lt;br/&gt;→ alignment shifts = 0&lt;br/&gt;→ pure integer adder tree" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
